{"1444080":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dewdrop Dynasty","steam_appid":1444080,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5023280],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looking for a lighthearted Metroidvania that isn't gloomy? We've got you covered.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dewdrop Dynasty<\/i> is a fast-paced, gun-jumping Metroidvania with a unique, retro-inspired pixel art style.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1444080\/extras\/e3502fae7b61b3ffe716836169848207.apng?t=1789339589\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1444080\/extras\/e3502fae7b61b3ffe716836169848207.poster.avif?t=1789339589\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=87 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, jump, and explore your way through the world of Dewdrop—a interconnected land filled with hidden secrets, diverse biomes, strange monsters, and even stranger inhabitants.   <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With so much to discover, bosses to face, and puzzles to solve, <i>Dewdrop Dynasty<\/i> bursts with charm, challenge, and fast-paced fun. <strong>The world of Dewdrop won’t explore itself—so what are you waiting for?<\/strong> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1444080\/extras\/bd065bd1b08a988af78ffd3b3b1431f0.apng?t=1789339589\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1444080\/extras\/bd065bd1b08a988af78ffd3b3b1431f0.poster.avif?t=1789339589\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=102 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_asse